  Title: Bosa
  Description: 'Like all cities in Soza, Bosa was given its name by one of the old
    gods. Most cities subtly rejected their given names by using nicknames, but fear
    of Bosa led to an inability for any nickname to stick.

    Bosa specializes
    in intelectual labor and houses most of Soza''s wealthy.'
